Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,提取她的血液样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a sample of her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后把尸体扔掉 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and then get rid of that. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:58.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《生化危机：灭绝》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,安布雷拉公司认为他们已经控制住了病毒的传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Umbrella Corporation thought they'd contained the infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实，他们错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从Raccoon城市开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raccoon City was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个星期后，T型病毒感染了整个美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within weeks, the T-virus had consumed the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月后，全球都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within months, the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒不仅吞噬了人类的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virus didn't just wipe out human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,河流和湖泊干涸了 森林变成了沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lakes and rivers dried up, forests became deserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的陆地都被\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whole continents were reduced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵蚀为贫瘠的荒野\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing more than barren wastelands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以确定的是，地球将慢慢的衰退，然后消亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly but surely, the Earth began to wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为数不多的幸存者都 要去适应去漂泊的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}What few survivors there were learned to keep on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们避开大城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}We avoided major cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们在一个地方呆时间太长，就会被它们发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stopped anyplace too long, they would be drawn to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是来几个，随后会越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a few at first, but then more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:08:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群僵尸组成的不死军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}A never-ending army of undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为幸存者的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those of us left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎只有不停的游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}staying on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能继存活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}seemed the only way to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（盐湖城市）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是KLKB 我们有7个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is KLKB. We have seven people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要紧急医治\N{\fnArial\fs30}in need of urgent medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助，这里是KLKB 有人听到吗 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help. This is KLKB. Can anyone hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来救我们吗？求求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone help us? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你救救我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的孩子摔倒地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dropped my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.03,0:10:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被包围了，我们需要帮忙 有人听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're surrounded. We need help. Can anyone hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来救我们吗？求求你们了 - 每次都管用啊，老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can anyone help us? Please. - Works every time, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她还带了些什么东西 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what else she's packing. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里面藏的是什么，傻妞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got down there, fishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你的话就不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点！ - 让这个婊子见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax! - Just show the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪！埃迪！埃迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! Eddie! Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐！他死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你很厉害，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you're pretty smart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着，婊子 我希望你死的别太快了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, bitch. I wouldn't want it to be over too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把笼子打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放它们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷的可真多啊，看到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a juicy one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，卡洛斯，我是克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carlos, this is Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有烟吗？ - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got any smokes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼才信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm supposed to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔，我会骗你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, would I lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- L.J。- 克莱尔 雷德菲尔德，有什么我能帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- L.J. - Claire Redfield, how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有烟吗？ - 这可帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got any smokes? - No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问你的搭档有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about alternate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉，我们都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to say we're out of that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也太打击我了，奥托有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be shitting me. Otto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思，伙计。在盐湖那我抽掉了最后一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, campers. Smoked the last of it back in Salt Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，伙计们 - 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, people - Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真的是世界末日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it really is the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有谁要发言？ - 巴黎的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyone else? - Paris facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,食品供应下降了50%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food supplies down to 50 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个人被感染 生化人数量持续增加中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six casualties. Biohazard numbers increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}London facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,食品供应下降了28% 有17人被感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food supplies down to 28 percent. Seventeen casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,生化人数量持续增加中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biohazard numbers increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有科学家参与这个会议真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good of the science division to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯克主席，我最近很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chairman Wesker. I've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生化危机问题上 科学家有什么建议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the subject of the biohazard, what is the science division's report?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样，我们现在得到这样一个结论 它们不需要任何食物来维持生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we now know conclusively that they have no real need for sustenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们渴望吃肉 但却不是必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hunger for flesh but do not require it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的研究表明 它们大约会存活10年左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}My research indicates they could remain active for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说我们要被困在地下10年？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're to be trapped underground for decades?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝项目有什么进展？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news of Project Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用她血液中的抗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using antibodies from her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:17:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我配制了一种血清 不仅可以击溃T型病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will develop a serum that will not just combat the effects of the T-virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还可以进化它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but potentially reverse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.82,0:17:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而使那些不生不死的家伙们重新获得一点智力\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving back these creatures a measure of their intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点记忆能力，同时还能控制他们吃肉的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}their memories, thus curbing their hunger for flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信心驯化它们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're confident you can domesticate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从本质上说，它们是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're animals, essentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能够除掉它们的某些本性，我们可以驯服它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can train them, if we can take away their baser instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不可能在变回人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们可以成为一种温顺的劳动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but would provide the basis for a docile workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以重新回到地面上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can return to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经试验了好几个月了 可你却仍没什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}After months of experiments, you have nothing to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在这里已经待腻了 - 没有了原版的艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are left to rot underground. - Without the original Project Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展变得缓慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}progress has been difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不得不去克隆她 不断的利用她的克隆体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been forced to replicate her using cloned genetic models.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是件很艰苦的事 而结果，是不确定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's laborious. The results, unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝计划和驯化项目拥有最高优先权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Alice and the subject of domestication is of the highest priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要全力投入到这两个项目上 不要管其他的研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will concentrate on this to the exclusion of all other research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望一周后会又新的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}We expect an updated report in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太急于求成不会得到很好的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply demanding results will not guarantee them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许我们应该再找个负责人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps we should place someone else in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可以满足我们需要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who can give us the reassurances we require.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续你的研究吧，博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue with your research, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那仍然是你负责的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}while it still is your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}This meeting is adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，史蒂维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about this, Stevie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德车队 我们在搜寻生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Claire Redfield's convoy, broadcasting for any survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.81,0:20:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生还者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在搜寻生还者 有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting for any survivors. Is anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德车队 我们在搜寻生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Claire Redfield's convoy, broadcasting for any survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生还者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德车队 目前已到达沙漠之迹旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Claire Redfield's convoy. Location, the Desert Trail Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在搜寻生还者 里面有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting for any survivors. ls there anybody in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在搜寻生还者 里面有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting for any survivors. ls there anybody in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续通信，麦基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep trying, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有生还者吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls there anyone alive in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:21:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来挺安静的 - 是啊，一直不都是这样的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seems quiet. - Yeah, don't they always?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有生还者吗？ 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone alive in there? Please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.69,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔，里面好像没人，我们要进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire. Looks clear. Shall we go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自己决定，伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your call, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧，我们上 - 我们去搜搜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Let's go. - Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get me a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡在水床上，来个按摩式浴缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take a waterbed, a Jacuzzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再弄本色情书刊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna rent me a porno.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.87,0:25:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你们俩还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? You two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.74,0:25:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，这里安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.15,0:25:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人需要我帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody need my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.45,0:25:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么了，不过要是你坚持的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing. But if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，坐回去，放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. So sit back and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家解散，都去找点我们需要的东西 汽油、食物、弹药，你们知道我们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out. Look for anything of use. Gas, food, ammo. You know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像是打了场硬仗，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like playing rough, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.47,0:25:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦，我还遇到过比这糟的呢 - 看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I've had worse. - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.91,0:25:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你总是对我这么好啊，贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've always been gentle with me, Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.88,0:25:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天呐，受不了你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.98,0:25:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该怎么说呢 你今晚到我那儿吃晚饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we say, dinner at my place tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.49,0:26:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，贝蒂！过来一下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Betty! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了 他知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing. He knows what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.61,0:27:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.78,0:27:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.66,0:27:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,站好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My God. - Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有了记忆和推理能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has memory and reasoning skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.38,0:27:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是奇迹啊，血浆起作用了，你真的驯化了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible. The serum works. You've domesticated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了，恭喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done it. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，博士！ 求你了，别这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, doctor! Please. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.70,0:27:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，别这样，博士 求你了，别这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, doctor. Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.69,0:28:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪肉豆子罐头，我再给你个小桃子罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pork and beans. I'll get some peaches for the little one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是芦笋罐头 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's asparagus. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}cat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.27,0:28:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开个玩笑了，那是猪肉豆子罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kidding. It's pork and beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.50,0:28:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 这是什么，猜猜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - What's this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.07,0:28:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汤，奶油蘑菇汤罐头 - 扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Soup. Cream of mushroom. - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.47,0:28:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜还是猪肉豆子罐头 - 谢谢，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think that's pork and beans too. - Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.68,0:28:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还真猜对了 - 芦笋罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be damned. - Asparagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.31,0:28:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么猜出来的？ - 这只是我的一点小本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do that? - Just one of my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜，只是濒临死亡的艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dying art, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.68,0:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一罐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜是一种水果的罐头 - 谢谢你，奥托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it's some kind of fruit. - Thanks, Otto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我们只有这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that's all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,水果，你想要水果罐头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fruit. You want some fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.83,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,水果，你想要水果罐头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fruit. You want some fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.77,0:29:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你查看过加油站了吗？ - 看过了，不过一点油都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you check out the gas station? - Yep, it's bone-dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.98,0:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这里情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how we looking here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.28,0:29:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔，如果铁锈能当燃料的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Claire, if we can run these trucks on rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来还蛮酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're looking pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.22,0:29:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视墙建起来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快弄好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁在外围？ - 奧利維拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's out there? - Olivera.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.33,0:29:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，卡洛斯 - 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Carlos. - Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟都把你抽垮了 加把劲，老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that smoking is slowing you down. Get your ass in gear, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.94,0:29:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧把监视墙布置好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my perimeter up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:30:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个监视器已经到位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last sentinel in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.59,0:30:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视墙可以运行了 所有的传感器都运转正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter's up and running. All motion sensors online.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影机工作完全正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cameras 100 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.54,0:30:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸豆泥，水果沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refried beans. Fruit salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，都是我最爱吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙尘暴要来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.41,0:30:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家把东西收拾起来都到车里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start packing it up and move it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧，孩子们，上车！ - 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, kids, let's go! - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.52,0:30:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,到车里面去，把火扑灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back in the bus. Put this fire out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德车队 已到达沙漠之迹旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Claire Redfield's convoy. Location, the Desert Trail Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,北纬35度，西经114度 搜寻生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lat. 35, long. 114. Calling any survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.80,0:31:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德车队 已到达沙漠之迹旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Claire Redfield's convoy. Location, the Desert Trail Motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.91,0:31:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,北纬35度，西经114度 搜寻生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lat. 35, long. 114. Calling any survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活第87号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate Number 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.56,0:33:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.06,0:33:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾萨克斯博士 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Isaacs. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的传感器检测到一个意念行为高峰信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sensors have detected a peak in psionic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,α和β射线都检测到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both alpha and beta wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是87号发出的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Number 87?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，那个意念行为不是从任何克隆体发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the activity's not from one of the clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它发生在复合实验室外\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt occurred outside the complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.41,0:34:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 我的传感器精确的检测到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not possible. - My sensors were quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.31,0:34:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟前检测到能量巨大意念行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Massive psionic activity was detected 15 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.12,0:34:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量中心位于沙漠地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}centered on a desert location.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.36,0:36:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔！ - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claire! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.55,0:36:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他妈怎么回事儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.36,0:36:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡洛斯 - 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlos. - I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都呆在卡车里别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay in your trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.14,0:36:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.37,0:36:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都呆在卡车里别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone just stay in your trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.71,0:36:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把窗户关上，保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll up the windows and keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，把窗户关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, close the windows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.47,0:37:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的眼睛怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with their eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.84,0:37:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们吃了被感染了的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been feeding on infected flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.92,0:37:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把车启动起来，我们得赶紧离开这儿 - 这可是个不错的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire it up. Let's get out of here. - That's a hell of an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock and load.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被卡住了 - 哦，别这样啊，我们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're stuck! - Hell, no, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.51,0:38:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到那辆公交车上去，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head for the bus, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.35,0:38:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，上来！ 快点，快点，快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get in! Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.87,0:38:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.20,0:38:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.87,0:38:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦基，卡洛斯 我们得回公交车那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey, Carlos, we have to evac the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.14,0:38:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.35,0:38:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.77,0:39:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点，快走！ - 别停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, move! - Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！快！快！快！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go! Go! Go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.79,0:39:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝蒂！ - 快走！别管我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Betty! - Go! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.00,0:39:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这儿，贝蒂！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, Betty! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.60,0:39:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！快！快！ - 开车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! Move! Move! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.21,0:39:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝蒂！贝蒂！ - LJ，快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Betty! Betty! - L.J., hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.77,0:40:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！贝蒂！贝蒂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Betty! Betty!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.27,0:40:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.41,0:40:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.29,0:40:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快开车！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.78,0:41:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.55,0:41:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,α和β射线又检测到了一个峰值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another spike in alpha and beta waves detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有百分之45的可能这是由艾莉丝发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-five percent probability that this is Project Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.49,0:41:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,三角定位，找到她的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triangulate. Find her location.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.40,0:41:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lmpressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.77,0:41:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是她的话，她的进化可真特别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf it is her, her development is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.37,0:41:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她逃离底特律实验基地开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her powers would appear to have grown at a geometric rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.30,0:41:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的能量会以几何形式增长\N{\fnArial\fs30}since her escape from the Detroit facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.98,0:42:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在24小时之内 你未经允许去过地表面10次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made 10 trips to the surface in the past 24 hours. All unauthorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.38,0:42:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次离开实验基地，尤其是去采集样品，都会使我的人冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any trip to the surface, especially to gather specimens, puts my men at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.85,0:42:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要突然出去这么多次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need so many all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.05,0:42:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaacs!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.06,0:42:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经加强了研究力度\N{\fnArial\fs30}My research has intensified.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，它们被困的很牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. They're perfectly secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该驯化它们的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be domesticating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.77,0:42:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候攻击力也是有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes aggression has its uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.98,0:42:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你需要这些家伙干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly need these things for?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.55,0:42:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,87号实验品已经到达了实验的最后阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specimen 87 has reached the final stage of the test grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.88,0:42:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，把监视画面调到屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Put her on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.39,0:42:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.50,0:42:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯克主席知道这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls Chairman Wesker even aware of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.47,0:42:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道他该知道的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what he needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.27,0:43:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的也太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've overstepped your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.04,0:43:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的研究将改变现在的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}My research will change the face of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.11,0:43:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要选择一个阵营的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you pick a side.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.58,0:43:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要选择一个正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}be sure it's the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.57,0:43:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.34,0:43:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.32,0:43:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This belong to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.88,0:43:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚给你戴上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave it to you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.89,0:43:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会带给你好运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.89,0:43:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.73,0:43:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.76,0:43:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}K-Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.10,0:43:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们找到我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where they found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.90,0:44:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire and the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前的事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.64,0:44:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有其他名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have another name?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.91,0:44:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都不喜欢那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.31,0:44:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识的每个人都死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone I knew was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎需要做些改变的时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so seemed like time for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.49,0:44:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想说点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone want to say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.95,0:44:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝，这是克莱尔 雷德菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, this is Claire Redfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.96,0:45:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是这个车队的组织者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the one who put this convoy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.63,0:45:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你出手帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.03,0:45:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.33,0:45:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下，有点事儿我得处理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I have things I have to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.14,0:45:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的6个月里 她损失了一半的车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln the last six months, she lost half of the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.01,0:45:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,过不了多久，我们会有更多的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon there'll be more of us dead than alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.98,0:45:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝，你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.39,0:45:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在底特律之后你为什么走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you leave after Detroit?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.39,0:45:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选择 他们在利用我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice. They were using me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.63,0:45:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.73,0:45:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were tracking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.63,0:45:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能靠近你们中的任何一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't be around you. Any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能让你们都被杀掉 - 所以你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would've gotten you all killed. - That's why you disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.27,0:45:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破译了密码进入了他们的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke into an Umbrella facility and hacked into their computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载了卫星的运行轨道信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}downloaded the satellite trajectories.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.41,0:45:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开了跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stayed off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.65,0:45:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界灭亡后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after the world ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.88,0:45:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么独自留在那儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why stay out there alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.22,0:46:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我离开了，大家会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just safer if I'm not around people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.09,0:46:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.72,0:46:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.85,0:46:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.46,0:46:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,蔡斯，现在几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase, what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.46,0:46:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，卡洛斯，十二点十四分 有什么想去的地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Carlos, it is 12:14. Why? You got somewhere you gotta be?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.97,0:46:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我刚刚又犯妄想症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm just being paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.68,0:46:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.69,0:47:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.96,0:47:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.69,0:47:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都很感激你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone is grateful for you helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.93,0:47:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我又能呆多久呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how long am I gonna stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.56,0:47:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.13,0:47:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的很感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really are grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.10,0:47:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在谈论你做过的事，他们很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all talking about what you did. And they're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.94,0:47:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有责怪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.68,0:47:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们习惯了我和死亡同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have a habit of dying around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.11,0:47:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.63,0:47:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're positive it's her?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.23,0:47:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,62%符合，不可能让她跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty-two percent. Too great a chance to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.53,0:47:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是艾莉丝 那么她已经躲避卫星追踪很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf it is Project Alice, she's been evading the satellite grid for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.60,0:47:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经改道发送了剩下的卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've re-routed the remaining satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.77,0:48:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切在我们的控制之中，她不会觉察到我们的监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can reacquire the subject. She'll be unaware of surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.94,0:48:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在一个小时内组织一支特攻队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can have a strike team ready within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.34,0:48:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们先要确定身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We'll establish a positive identification first.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.75,0:48:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分百的确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.62,0:48:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她一起的人很有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}The group she's with include known associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.99,0:48:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,原版的艾莉丝对我的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original Project Alice is vital to my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.72,0:48:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和整个驯化项目至关重要 她的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the whole process of domestication. Her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.56,0:48:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的基因结构是成功的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}her genetic structure, is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.96,0:48:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在外面时间越长 我们失去她的可能就越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer she's out there, the greater chance we lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.03,0:48:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能冒险 - 决定权不在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't risk that. - That decision isn't yours to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.04,0:48:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下次会议委员会讨论前 你不能擅自行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take no action until this matter has been discussed by the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一点，博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the next scheduled meeting. And, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.61,0:48:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.32,0:48:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是几个月来最接近有生命迹象的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}These transmissions are the best indication of life we've seen in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.19,0:48:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯加？ - 我们应该去查看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alaska? - We have to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.29,0:48:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能忽视它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.89,0:48:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道路上会发生什么事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what kind of journey that would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道，会很漫长 - 最后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. A long one. - And at the end of it, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.33,0:48:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们甚至不能保证那有活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no guarantee there's even anyone alive up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.23,0:49:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 传送的信号显示 - 那是六个月前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These transmissions say that - They're dated six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.94,0:49:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回复了多少无线信号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many radio broadcasts have we responded to?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.20,0:49:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少次我们晚到一步？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have we got there too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.97,0:49:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号显示那儿没有被污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmissions say that there's no infection up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.98,0:49:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.68,0:49:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.02,0:49:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个车队的人把他们的生命交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This convoy trusts me with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.95,0:49:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不需要白日梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people don't need pipe dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.42,0:49:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那正是他们需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's exactly what they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.56,0:49:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔，看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.23,0:49:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前我们有50个人 然后40，现在不过30\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months ago, there were 50 of us, then 40, now there's less than 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.43,0:49:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're starting to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need some kind of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.24,0:49:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做个抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.25,0:49:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它的重要性 所以我无法代大家决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's too big, it's too important for me to make for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.32,0:49:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里也许会有生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chance there are survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.56,0:49:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.26,0:50:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.63,0:50:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,污染没有扩散的那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the infection hasn't reached that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.93,0:50:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.37,0:50:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这只是一个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.10,0:50:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以继续留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.14,0:50:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者去阿拉斯加碰碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we try for Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.68,0:50:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持去阿拉斯加的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.45,0:50:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉斯加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.97,0:50:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.51,0:50:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.73,0:51:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物都吃完了 油也快没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The food's virtually gone and the truck's running on empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.13,0:51:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄到了半桶油，给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got half a tank of gas. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蔡斯 - 去他的，我甚至连个空油桶都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chase? - Shit, I don't even have empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.94,0:51:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的够走一百英里的，上好的油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got enough for a hundred miles, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.01,0:51:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要去的话 就必须补给一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf we're gonna make this trip, we'll need to resupply.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.91,0:51:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.55,0:51:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这些选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are our options.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.41,0:51:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近最安全的选择就是去那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nearest, safest bet is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.62,0:51:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边是空的，我已经试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's empty. I tried that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.16,0:51:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，好的，也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.26,0:51:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以试试这个 - 拉斯维加斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could try this - Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.03,0:51:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿是唯一我确信可以弄到补给的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only place we're sure to find gas and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.80,0:51:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是拉斯维加斯很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason for that. Vegas is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.50,0:51:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些杂种一起爬行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crawling with them sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.37,0:51:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的六个月 我们已经去过了每一个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've drained every small town dry over the last six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.54,0:51:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去一个大点儿的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hit a big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.17,0:51:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.18,0:52:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯是我们唯一能去的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vegas, it's our only bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将做一个身份识别\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll establish a positive identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.49,0:52:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之一百的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.79,0:52:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要轻举妄动 等着委员会来讨论这件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take no action until this matter has been discussed by the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.63,0:52:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.51,0:52:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,委员会签署了立即行动令\N{\fnArial\fs30}The committee authorizes immediate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.25,0:52:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给车辆和人员放行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release of vehicles and personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.38,0:52:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,由艾萨克斯博士签署\N{\fnArial\fs30}under command of Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.09,0:52:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.18,0:54:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.75,0:54:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.18,0:54:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些猪肉和豆类，那些致命的玩意 我不知道你们是怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them pork and beans, they lethal. I don't see how you cowboys do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.19,0:54:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.19,0:54:36.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到拉斯维加斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.94,0:54:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.74,0:55:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The desert must have taken it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.58,0:55:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,5年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.94,0:55:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人去阻止沙化过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one to keep the sand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.06,0:55:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.19,0:55:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.23,0:55:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些鸟搜遍了这个城市的每一个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those birds must have moved through the city block by block.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.43,0:55:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洗了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.24,0:55:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有看见有卡车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any truck stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.61,0:55:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.61,0:55:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.05,0:55:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦利特停在了卡西诺赌场上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valet parking at the casino up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.92,0:56:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gas pumps in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.95,0:56:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.86,0:56:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我在这儿输了两千块\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped two G's back in the day here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.22,0:56:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了两千美金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost $2000?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.81,0:56:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.29,0:56:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.06,0:56:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把它们搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.54,0:57:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，蔡斯，帮我看着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Chase, I need a lookout!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.68,0:57:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.82,0:57:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.97,0:57:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,带一支大口径步枪到艾菲尔铁塔那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb the Eiffel Tower with a high-powered rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.67,0:57:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年以前这是会引起骚动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ago, that would've caused a stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.61,0:57:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，暂时享受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let the good times roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.14,0:57:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把这个搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.80,0:58:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这个鬼地方 麦基，准备好绞盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here. Mikey, get the winch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.34,0:58:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.24,0:58:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.18,0:58:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.61,0:59:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡洛斯，掩护我 - 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlos, cover me! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.50,1:00:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.39,1:00:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后边去，冷静 走，快，快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get to the back and stay quiet. Go! Now! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.16,1:00:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.47,1:01:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really is magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.14,1:02:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她一死 你一定迅速行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she's dead, make sure you move in fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.21,1:02:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一份她的血样 要热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a sample of her blood while it's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.15,1:02:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.15,1:02:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卫星到位了吗？ - 是的，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Satellite in position? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.13,1:02:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then shut her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.00,1:02:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦基！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.31,1:03:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.79,1:03:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦基！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.86,1:03:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.80,1:03:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.00,1:04:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fighting the conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.53,1:04:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强控制信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boost the control signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.58,1:04:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.88,1:04:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上来，把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb! Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.92,1:04:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.32,1:04:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.59,1:04:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.14,1:04:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.J.\N{\fnArial\fs30}L.J.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.67,1:05:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.01,1:05:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite. Some kind of malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.67,1:05:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.04,1:05:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要15秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}New feed coming online in 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.45,1:06:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,3，2，1\N{\fnArial\fs30}Online in three, two.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.82,1:06:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.99,1:06:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底去要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is she going?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.40,1:06:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.90,1:06:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她仍在接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.67,1:06:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点儿把她关掉 - 哦，见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.58,1:06:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.58,1:06:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to base!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.39,1:06:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗体 给我抗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anti-virus! Get me the anti-virus!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.61,1:07:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不开枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.05,1:07:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们不能开车去阿拉斯加我要一架完整的直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're not driving to Alaska. I want that helicopter intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.42,1:07:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去看看电脑 查查他们去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go look at the computer, see where that chopper's headed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.73,1:07:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样了？ - 在禁闭室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is he? - Under house arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.50,1:07:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,照你的命令 他已经安静下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you instructed. He's been quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.02,1:07:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了多少剂量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much of this have you used?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.99,1:07:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的血提升了那些生物的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her blood increased the creatures' power.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.96,1:07:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还加强了影响的强度\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt also increased the strength of the infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.40,1:07:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.40,1:07:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这对你来说意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what this will do to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.51,1:08:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.74,1:08:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的控制权失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of control.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.51,1:08:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this ends here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.15,1:08:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据第1354号命令 由韦斯克授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under executive order 1345, issued by Chairman Wesker.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.12,1:08:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了偿付在这个研究上的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}for gross misconduct in the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.69,1:08:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被液化掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sentence you to summary liquidation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.76,1:08:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,液化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liquidation?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.39,1:08:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是死去而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just die.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.87,1:08:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把尸体弄走 给我关于艾莉丝的所有资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the body to the surface. Bring me the stats on Program Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.14,1:08:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.07,1:09:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我们喜欢挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we like a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.52,1:09:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.72,1:09:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.19,1:09:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿能找到抗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the anti-virus in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.96,1:09:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.80,1:09:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太迟了，你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.93,1:09:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，你得想个办法进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you need a way to get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.97,1:09:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.02,1:09:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会保证他们的安全的，对吧？ - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You keep them safe, huh? - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.01,1:10:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯，我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos, I.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.82,1:10:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.66,1:10:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚答应过我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just promise me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.03,1:10:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一到下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.33,1:10:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我能来上一口烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I had a smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.69,1:12:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.34,1:12:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.47,1:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,LJ，你个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}L.J., you sneaky son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.48,1:12:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.52,1:12:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把孩子们都带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the kids out quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.97,1:13:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.84,1:13:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! Run! Hurry up! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.78,1:13:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快，快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.08,1:13:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.16,1:13:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打算一起走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.03,1:13:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.17,1:17:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我不是有意要吓到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to startle you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.74,1:17:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是人工智能人 - 我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am the artificial intelligence - I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.07,1:17:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.87,1:17:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个嗜血狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a homicidal bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.24,1:17:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐的程序只会照逻辑行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister computer was merely following the most logical path.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.38,1:17:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护人类的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the preservation of human life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.38,1:17:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，杀了一些，救了许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Kill a few, save a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.49,1:17:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这儿到底发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.02,1:17:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士被咬了 回来的时候已经受感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isaacs returned in an infected state. He was bitten by a creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.99,1:17:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些生物已经用一种新的血清处理过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had been treated with a newly developed serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.83,1:17:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的血液里提取的血清\N{\fnArial\fs30}A serum derived from your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.96,1:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果引起了巨大的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The resulting infection has caused massive mutation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.90,1:17:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的血液？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.10,1:18:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血液已经和T病毒绑定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood has bonded with the T-virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.17,1:18:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士正确的推断出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Isaacs correctly deduced.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.91,1:18:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以用来摧毁那些变异生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it could be used to destroy the biohazard for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.21,1:18:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我的血可以拯救这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean my blood is the cure for all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.62,1:18:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.72,1:18:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么帮我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.62,1:18:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的血液是纯净的 这个设备有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood is pure, and this facility contains.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.76,1:18:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你需要用来合成药剂的仪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of the equipment you will require to synthesize a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.56,1:18:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说这一切都可以结束了 - 非常正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean this could all end? - Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.13,1:18:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is, however.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.30,1:18:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}a small problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.71,1:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他困在了下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have him contained in the lower levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.08,1:18:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没法困住他更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I cannot hold him there for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.88,1:18:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.70,1:19:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.93,1:19:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.21,1:23:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.06,1:24:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.67,1:24:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.99,1:24:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.95,1:24:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久了，我一直以为你代表着未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For so long, I thought you were the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.59,1:24:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.59,1:25:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是真正的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.83,1:25:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.20,1:25:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.07,1:25:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}another asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.91,1:25:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're both gonna die down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.56,1:25:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，你就是未来，好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're the future, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.77,1:26:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有试图和北美联系的努力都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All attempts to contact the North American facility continue to fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.37,1:26:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,中断多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have they been off the air?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.51,1:26:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,17个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.64,1:26:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能失踪了 但是我们的计划保持不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must consider them lost. But our plans remain unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.21,1:26:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的数据都会传到这个设备上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All data will be transferred to this facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.62,1:26:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究会在我个人的监督下继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the research will continue under my personal supervision.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.22,1:26:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望一个月之内能出结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect results within one month.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.89,1:26:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们，你们不会等太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't have to wait that long, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.49,1:26:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我马上就会来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.59,1:26:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.26,1:26:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会带一些朋友一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be bringing a few of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.55,1:33:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.39,1:33:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}another asshole.
